DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       ffcc--vvaalliiddaattee validates _f_o_n_t_-_f_i_l_e(s) if each fonts satisfies the language
       coverage  according to the orthography files in fontconfig.  If ----iinnddeexx
       is given, only one face of each file is validated, otherwise all  faces
       are validated.

OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       This  program  follows the usual GNU command line syntax, with long op‐
       tions starting with two dashes (`-'). A summary of options is  included
       below.

       --ii     Only query face indexed _i_n_d_e_x of each file.

       --ll     Set  _l_a_n_g  as a language instead of current locale. this is used
              for --mm.

       --vv     Show more detailed information.

       --VV     Show version of the program and exit.

       --hh     Show summary of options.

       _f_o_n_t_-_f_i_l_e
              Query _f_o_n_t_-_f_i_l_e for font faces.

RREETTUURRNN CCOODDEESS
       ffcc--vvaalliiddaattee returns error code 0 for successful parsing, or  1  if  any
       errors occurred or if at least one font face could not be opened.

